# Blademaster's native checks by parity: #124 Wind Walk Backstab and Mirror Image swap.
# Blademaster a against Blademaster b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero blademaster
# 7bc2877cdb (traction) and 1e934c1718 and db647159a5 (dash and run caps) leave b short of the Backstab and swap slash
# (probe run 39025558252 with them neutralised hits both), so b holds its dash to 45 (variant run 39025737993).
40 b stick -1 0
45 b stick 0 0
# Wind Walk toward b, Backstab on its 16th frame.
60 a stick 1 0
60 a tap X 2
61 a stick 0 0
75 a tap A 2
# Mirror Image, then the swap with its slash.
200 a stick 0 -1
200 a tap X 2
201 a stick 0 0
260 a stick 0 -1
260 a tap X 2
261 a stick 0 0
# Counterplay: b's held shield blocks the swap slash.
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
600 a stick 0 -1
600 a tap X 2
601 a stick 0 0
620 b shield 1
650 a stick 0 -1
650 a tap X 2
651 a stick 0 0
700 b shield 0
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script):
#! expect a 60 special 14 form 0
#! expect a 75 special-form 6 action 14
# acc966bbfb (#45) cut Backstab to 8.5 and 8cd9c77933 (#414) set the swap slash to 7.745 (trace: run 40099235057).
#! expect b 80 damage 8.500
#! expect a 200 special 16 form 0
# #333 (cb83c0780) slows b's entry dash; #338 (8a9eb0218) pushes their
# overlapping bodies apart before Mirror Image leaves its 132-unit step.
# 7bc2877cdb's per-hero traction and b's longer dash move this stop: probe run 39008307513 with traction neutralised keeps -216.196 (trace: run 39025737993).
#! expect a 223 special 0 form 0 action-frame 0 x -214.636
#! expect a 260 special 16 form 3
#! expect b 267 damage 16.245
#! expect a 650 special 16 form 3
#! absent b 620-700 damage
#! scene a MirrorImageCaster
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
